## Subtask Updates

After verifying a subtask passes all its acceptance criteria, update its status:
```bash
4x subtask {{ .Feature.ID }} <subtask-id> --status done
```

## Rules

- SKIP > 30% of total items → blocks acceptance
- Do NOT modify source code — only report issues
- Do NOT fabricate test results — if you can't test something, mark it SKIP with reason

## Escalation

If acceptance criteria are wrong or environment is broken:
```json
{
  "escalation": {
    "needed": true,
    "reason": "criteria-wrong | blocker",
    "detail": "Describe the issue"
  }
}
```
